OL,3,GNEWSAWestminster's time is coming to an
OL,4,Aend, Welsh, Scottish, Northern Irish
OL,5,Aleaders say
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut while Scotland's John Swinney and
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland's Michelle O'Neill
OL,9,Fcalled for referendums at a joint press
OL,10,Fconference, Wales' Rhun ap Iorwerth
OL,11,Fdeclined to give a timetable for one in
OL,12,Fhis country.
OL,14,FLabour and Reform accused Plaid of
OL,15,Fwanting to break up the UK.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
